# .claude-context — nutrition-labels repo map (token-optimized)

## Stack
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript, Vite, Zustand (recipe/saved/prefs/theme), React Query, Tailwind, react-router-dom, @react-pdf/renderer (client-side PDF), @dnd-kit
- **Backend**: FastAPI + SQLite (read-only, FTS5), slowapi. **Data-only** — 3 endpoints (health, search, food detail). NO PDF work happens server-side anymore.
- **Infra**: docker-compose — db-init → backend(:8000) + frontend(nginx) behind Caddy TLS

