### Stores (Zustand)
- **`recipeStore`** — active recipe; NOT persisted. All ingredient actions key off `instanceId`.
  - State: `ingredients, portionDivisor, labelName, dimensions, highlightedNutrients, instructions, variables, servingHousehold, addedSugarsG, transFatG, currentRecipeId, viewingVersionId`
  - Ingredient actions: `add/remove/updateName/updateAmount/updateUnit (preserves grams)/updatePortion (preserves grams)/moveIngredient`
  - Meta actions: `setPortionDivisor/setLabelName/setDimensions/setHighlightedNutrients/setServingHousehold/setAddedSugarsG/setTransFatG` (added-sugars/trans-fat clamp to ≥0, coerce NaN→0)
  - Step actions: `addStep(afterId?) → id / updateStepText / removeStep / moveStep`
  - Variable actions: `addVariable / setVariableValue / updateVariable / removeVariable`
  - Lifecycle: `clearRecipe / loadRecipe (latest version) / loadVersion / exitVersionView / setCurrentRecipeId`
  - Internal `withInstanceIds` back-fills legacy persisted rows.
- **`savedRecipesStore`** — `nl_saved_recipes` v2; max 50 recipes × 20 versions.
  - Exports `type RecipeSnapshot` (superset of RecipeVersion fields, minus id/savedAt/note).
  - Actions: `createRecipe(snapshot, note?) → id / appendVersion(id, snapshot, note?) / renameRecipe / deleteRecipe / deleteVersion` (deleting the last version deletes the recipe).
- **`preferencesStore`** — `nl_preferences`; `recents` (max 15) + `favorites` + `isMethodExpanded`.
- **`themeStore`** — `nl-theme`; ThemeKey: `"paper"|"overcast"|"twilight"|"midnight"`; `useActiveTheme()`, `themeVars(def, accentHex)` → CSS custom props.

### Hooks (frontend/src/hooks)
`useNutritionCalc` (memoized live macros) · `useIngredientSearch` (React Query, 300ms debounce, staleTime 30s, enabled ≥2 chars) · `useDebounce<T>` · `useLabelResize` (pointer-drag, 96px/in, clamps 200–600px → 2.08–6.25in) · `useAnimatedNumber` (rAF, default 420ms, cubic ease-out) · `useRecipeActions` (useShallow) · `usePageMeta` (title + meta/canonical) · `useAdSenseBootstrap` (script injection, no-op when disabled) · `useTitleAutoResize` · `useLabelSave` (snapshot construction, save/appendVersion, "SAVED ✓" flash, `lastSavedRel` relative-time via `Intl.DateTimeFormat`).
